{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592020/extras/e12af58231a7e807e2ad522e0cdf1d7c.avif?t=1774105334\" width=600 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Sparky Rush?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparky Rush is a third-person 3D platformer game from the PS1 era featuring elements of psychological and meta-horror where its developer descends into complete madness. In the story, you must help the character Sparky from the famous cartoon <i>The Amazing Sparky!</i> (1940) to save his friends from the clutches of the evil genius cat, Sweetie!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592020/extras/7ee607ff66843537b92159e834349e58.poster.avif?t=1774105334\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592020/extras/7ee607ff66843537b92159e834349e58.webm?t=1774105334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In Sparky Rush you will:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Sparky to traverse obstacles to unlock new levels and secret areas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect items to unlock the full power of the great Sparky!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles to unveil the obscure rabbithole left by the developer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592020/extras/01d5a2f88832bc108de40d39e8fc880f.poster.avi